## Rebuttal
The synthesis underweighted the maintenance cost dimension.

## Underweighted Argument
The team's familiarity with Option A's library was framed as a "minor weakness"
but it's actually load-bearing — the same team will be on-call for the next 3
years and the cognitive tax compounds.

## Revised Position
Holding. The shipping-speed argument still dominates given the 6-week deadline,
but I'd weight maintenance higher if the deadline were softer.
